  if (\n     Is the value of the ""vro_delete_old_versions"" property     \n     set to ""true"" (""vro_delete_old_versions=true"")?     \n) then (Yes - Clean Up Old Versions of Orchestrator Content)

    :===Clean Up Old Versions of Orchestrator Content
    (Old Versions of Bundle Packages);

