partition Clean Up VCD Content {

  if (\n     Is the value of the ""vcd_delete_old_versions"" property     \n     set to ""true"" (""vcd_delete_old_versions=true"")?     \n) then (Yes - Print Log Message About VCD Content Cleanup)

  :===Print Log Message About VCD Content Cleanup
  VMware Cloud Director clean up is not supported yet.
  ;

